  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "たたかいのまいを　はげしく　おどって\nきあいを　たかめる。\nじぶんの　こうげきを　ぐーんと　あげる。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "싸움의 춤을 격렬하게 춰서\n기세를 높인다.\n자신의 공격을 크게 올린다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "激烈地跳起戰舞提升氣勢，\n大幅提高自己的攻擊。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Une danse frénétique qui exalte l’esprit combatif.\nAugmente beaucoup l’Attaque du lanceur.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Ein wilder Tanz, der den Kampfgeist wecken soll.\nDer Angriffs-Wert des Anwenders wird stark erhöht.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Baile frenético que aumenta mucho el Ataque.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Danza frenetica che incrementa lo spirito\ncombattivo. Chi la usa aumenta di molto\nil suo Attacco.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A frenetic dance to uplift the fighting spirit.\nThis sharply raises the user’s Attack stat.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "戦いの舞を　激しく　おどって\n気合を　高める。\n自分の　攻撃を　ぐーんと　あげる。",
      "version_group": {
